{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echo\u2019s Inc \u2013 Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-thriving tech company researching A.I. and lucid dreaming has gone dark. You are <strong>Melvin</strong>, a former employee returning after a decade of silence. <br>Reality unravels as you explore the facility. Shadows whisper. Something still watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/951a007a5428199be3e2319d907132b5.poster.avif?t=1757422723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/951a007a5428199be3e2319d907132b5.webm?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/951a007a5428199be3e2319d907132b5.mp4?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat just tension, puzzles, and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a decaying facility filled with hidden areas and disturbing clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/c505fe0c84bf9c67dcfc66a0c8f0f290.poster.avif?t=1757422723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/c505fe0c84bf9c67dcfc66a0c8f0f290.webm?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/c505fe0c84bf9c67dcfc66a0c8f0f290.mp4?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visuals &amp; Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volumetric lighting, fog, and post-processing effects blur dreams and reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting spaces and unnatural shadows build a sense of dread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual effects tie directly into the psychological experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/37d68a631805efdf4dc3648c1305142b.poster.avif?t=1757422723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/37d68a631805efdf4dc3648c1305142b.webm?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/37d68a631805efdf4dc3648c1305142b.mp4?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven, 1\u20132 hour experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive horror without combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story told through environments, documents, and audio logs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden content for replayability</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039010?t=1757422723","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039010?t=1757422723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/80c47fa260e713636f8048f3bb2dc6c41c8ed44b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757422723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/80c47fa260e713636f8048f3bb2dc6c41c8ed44b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757422723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains intense horror elements designed to create a chilling and immersive experience. The content includes:\r\n\r\n    Graphic Horror Themes: The game features vivid and unsettling horror scenarios, including depictions of fear-inducing environments and supernatural occurrences.\r\n    Violence: There are scenes of violence that are integral to the horror experience. These depictions are intended to enhance the atmosphere and sense of dread.\r\n    Swearing: The game includes strong language to maintain an authentic and intense horror experience.\r\n\r\nPlease note that while the game does not contain depictions of sexual acts, sexual assault, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm, the atmosphere and content are designed to be disturbing and frightening. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echo\u2019s Inc \u2013 Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-thriving tech company researching A.I. and lucid dreaming has gone dark. You are <strong>Melvin</strong>, a former employee returning after a decade of silence. <br>Reality unravels as you explore the facility. Shadows whisper. Something still watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/951a007a5428199be3e2319d907132b5.poster.avif?t=1757422723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/951a007a5428199be3e2319d907132b5.webm?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/951a007a5428199be3e2319d907132b5.mp4?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat just tension, puzzles, and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a decaying facility filled with hidden areas and disturbing clues</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/c505fe0c84bf9c67dcfc66a0c8f0f290.poster.avif?t=1757422723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/c505fe0c84bf9c67dcfc66a0c8f0f290.webm?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/c505fe0c84bf9c67dcfc66a0c8f0f290.mp4?t=1757422723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visuals &amp; Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volumetric lighting, fog, and post-processing effects blur dreams and reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting spaces and unnatural shadows build a sense of dread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual effects tie directly into the psychological experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039010/extras/37d68a631805efdf4dc3648c1305142b.poster.avif?t=1